<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Web Development Standards Implementation</title>

<style>

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background-color:#f4f8fc;
    line-height:1.6;
}

header{
    background:#0d6efd;
    color:white;
    padding:25px;
    text-align:center;
}

nav{
    background:#084298;
    padding:15px;
    text-align:center;
}

nav a{
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    margin:20px;
    font-size:18px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

nav a:hover{
    color:yellow;
}

section{
    background:white;
    margin:25px;
    padding:25px;
    border-radius:12px;
    box-shadow:0px 0px 10px lightgray;
}

h2{
    color:#0d6efd;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

p{
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

video{
    border-radius:10px;
    width:100%;
    max-width:600px;
}

label{
    font-weight:bold;
}

input{
    width:100%;
    padding:10px;
    margin-top:5px;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

button{
    background:#0d6efd;
    color:white;
    border:none;
    padding:12px 25px;
    border-radius:5px;
    cursor:pointer;
    font-size:16px;
}

button:hover{
    background:#084298;
}

pre{
    background:#eeeeee;
    padding:15px;
    border-radius:5px;
    overflow:auto;
}

ul{
    margin-left:20px;
}

footer{
    background:#0d6efd;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:15px;
    margin-top:20px;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>


<header>

<h1>Web Development Standards Implementation</h1>
<p>Modern Web Application Development Assignment</p>

</header>



<nav>

<a href="#video">Video</a>
<a href="#form">Registration</a>
<a href="#navigation">Navigation</a>
<a href="#xml">XML</a>
<a href="#protocol">HTTP</a>

</nav>



<section id="video">

<h2>1. HTML5 Video Embedding</h2>

<p>
The HTML5 &lt;video&gt; tag is used to embed promotional videos on web pages.
</p>

<video controls autoplay muted loop>

<source
src="https://interactive-examples.mdn.mozilla.net/media/cc0-videos/flower.mp4"
type="video/mp4">

Your browser does not support the video tag.

</video>

</section>




<section id="form">

<h2>2. Registration Form (POST Method)</h2>

<p>
The POST method securely sends user information to the server.
</p>

<form action="#" method="POST">

<label>Full Name</label>
<input type="text" placeholder="Enter your name" required>


<label>Email Address</label>
<input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email" required>


<label>Password</label>
<input type="password" placeholder="Enter your password" required>


<button type="submit">Register</button>

</form>

</section>




<section id="navigation">

<h2>3. Semantic Navigation Element</h2>

<p>
The semantic HTML &lt;nav&gt; element is used to represent navigation links.
It improves accessibility and search engine optimization.
</p>

<pre>
<nav>
   Home
   About
   Services
   Contact
</nav>
</pre>

</section>




<section id="xml">

<h2>4. Correct XML Syntax</h2>

<p>
XML documents must follow proper syntax rules.
</p>

<pre>
&lt;?xml version="1.0"?&gt;

&lt;note&gt;
    &lt;to&gt;User&lt;/to&gt;
    &lt;from&gt;Admin&lt;/from&gt;
&lt;/note&gt;
</pre>


<h3>XML Rules</h3>

<ul>
<li>Every opening tag must have a closing tag.</li>
<li>Tags must be properly nested.</li>
<li>XML is case-sensitive.</li>
<li>XML documents should be well-formed.</li>
</ul>

</section>




<section id="protocol">

<h2>5. Web Communication Protocol (HTTP/HTTPS)</h2>

<p>
HTTP (HyperText Transfer Protocol) is used for communication between
the browser and the web server.
</p>

<p>
HTTPS is the secure version of HTTP that encrypts user data during
communication.
</p>

<pre>

Browser
   |
HTTP Request
   |
Web Server
   |
HTTP Response
   |
Displays Web Page

</pre>

</section>




<footer>

<p>Submitted for Web Technologies Assignment</p>

</footer>



</body>
</html>
